  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "Trim the asparagus and cut into 1-inch pieces.",
    "In a bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the asparagus to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the asparagus onto skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the asparagus for 3-4 minutes per side, or until tender and slightly charred.",
    "Serve the asparagus hot, topped with crumbled feta cheese.",
    "Garnish with lemon wedges and fresh parsley, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy."
